e\" data-target=\"#navbar-collapse\" aria-expanded=\"false\" >\n36:           <span class=\"sr-only\">Toggle navigation</span>\n37:           <span class=\"icon-bar\" ></span>\n38:           <span class=\"icon-bar\" ></span>\n39:           <span class=\"icon-bar\" ></span>\n40:         </button> \n41:       <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navbar-collapse\" >\n42:         <ul class=\"nav navbar-nav \">\n43:           <li><a href=\"./index.html\" title=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 45, 45);\" >meewoodesign</a></li>\n44:           <li><a href=\"./works.php?pageNum=0\" title=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 45, 45);\" >projets</a></li>\n45:           <li><a href=\"./about.html\" title=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(45, 45, 45);\">à propos</a></li>\n46:           <li><a href=\"./contact.html\" title=\"\" style=\"color:rgb(45, 45, 45);\">contact</a></li>\n47:         </ul>\n48: \n49: \n50:       </div> \n51:     </div>\n52:   </nav>\n53: </header>\n54: \n55: <div class=\"section-container\">\n56:     <div class=\"container\">\n57:       <div class=\"row\">\n58:         <div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n59:           <div class=\"section-container-spacer text-center\">\n60:             <h1 class=\"h2\">à propos</h1>\n61:           </div>\n62:           \n63:           <div class=\"row\">\n64:             <div class=\"col-md-10 col-md-offset-1\">\n65:               <div class=\"row\">\n66:                 <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-12\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n67:                   <h3>meewoodesign</h3>\n68:                   <br>\n69:                   <p>Fondé en 1999, meewoodesign crée un nouvel espace basé sur la confiance et la solidité sous la direction du PDG Jang Joon-ho.\n70: \n71:                     Les détails luxueux et l'harmonie de meewoodesign améliorent la perfection des bureaux, des établissements d'enseignement et des installations commerciales.\n72:                     \n73:                     Nous promettons de fournir aux clients un espace meilleur et plus habitable avec des conceptions qui regardent le passé, vivent dans le présent et regardent vers l'avenir. </p>\n74:                   <br>  \n75:                   <p>\n76:                     1999년 설립된 미우디자인은 대표이사 장준호의 지휘하에 신뢰와 견고함을 바탕으로 새로운 공간을 창조해내고 있습니다.\n77:                   미우디자인의 고급스러운 디테일, 조화로움은 사무실, 교육 시설,  상업 시설 등에 완성도를 높입니다.\n78:                   과거를 되돌아보는, 현재를 살아가는, 미래를 바라보는  디자인으로 더 나은 공간, 더 살만한 공간을 고객들에게 제공할 것을 약속드립니다.\n79:                   </p>\n80:                   <br>\n81:                   <br>\n82:                   <h3>Jang Joon-ho</h3>\n83:                   <img src=\"images/싸인.png\" style=\"width: 100px;\">\n84:                 </div>\n85:                 <!-- <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n86:                   <img src=\"images/main2.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive\" alt=\"\">\n87:                 </div> -->\n88:               </div>\n89:             </div>\n90:           </div>\n91:           \n92:           \n93:        </div>\n94:       </div>\n95:     </div>\n96:   </div>\n97: \n98: \n99: <!-- <footer class=\"footer-container text-center\">\n100:   <div class=\"container\">\n101:     <div class=\"row\">\n102:       <div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n103:         <p>© UNTITLED | Website created with <a href=\"http://www.mashup-template.com/\" title=\"Create website with free html template\">Mashup Template</a>/<a href=\"https://www.unsplash.com/\" title=\"Beautiful Free Images\">Unsplash</a></p>\n104:       </div>\n105:     </div>\n106:   </div>\n107: </footer> -->\n108: \n109: <script>\n110:   document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function (event) {\n111:      navActivePage();\n112:   });\n113: </script>\n114: \n115: <!-- Google Analytics: change UA-XXXXX-X to be your site's ID \n116: \n117: <script>\n118:   (function (i, s, o, g, r, a, m) {\n119:     i['GoogleAnalyticsObject'] = r; i[r] = i[r] || function () {\n120:       (i[r].q = i[r].q || []).push(arguments)\n121:     }, i[r].l = 1 * new Date(); a = s.createElement(o